      "cooked": "<p>so my friend and i were playing (one hero each)i was mister fixer and my friend was visionary.<br>\nwe were fighting plague rat, in pike.<br>\nwe killed plague locust pretty fast but then i died. then my friend draw telekinetic cocoon and then for the rest of the 20 minute game the environment we won but it was not a fun game.<br>\nwe trend the same thing with kismet i think with nightmist's misinform but it was destroyed soon after begin played.<br>\nso maybe not broken but maybe not in the \"spirit\" of the game.</p>",
