      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>The game breaks with only 2 heroes. It screws up the (H) mechanism. This is not currently sufficiently clear in the rulebook.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For 2 players, at least one of them needs to play multiple heroes. Setting (H) at a minimum of 3 might also work, but I haven’t tried that.</p>",
