      "created_at": "2019-08-15T12:59:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I would think Sewer Fiend would ruin the ability to have the environment take Plague Rat out by environment damage. &nbsp;Regardless, using Cocoon or Mistform can help you win games where the environment/villain don’t have&nbsp;Ongoing destruction but&nbsp;it’s certainly&nbsp;not an entertaining way to accomplish it. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
