    {
      "id": 228491,
      "name": "steveothemocker",
      "username": "steveothemocker",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/s/bc79bd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-08-26T20:44:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This sounds like the game we played against Iron Legacy over the weekend. Skyscraper, Naturalist and Bunker in the Wagner Mars base. Turn 2 Meteor storm came into play, so we spent numerous rounds loading omni-cannon while&nbsp;immune to damage.&nbsp; Then played Emergency Evac to get rid of both Meteor storms by then, and have bunker one-shot Iron Legacy.&nbsp; There's was a small risk between Pervasive Red dust and Iron Legacy's destory H equipment cards that we would lose the Cannon but between Bunker and Skyscaper's Links we kept enough others in play to not matter. It's proabably the cheesiest game we've ever had.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 7,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:02:59.533Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
